{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/d5d178a95d133b99fc4d11246cda8c76.avif?t=1772593004\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shields of Loyalty is a turn-based dark fantasy strategy game. It is set in a thematic 2D world inspired by a legacy of genre classics, enriched with great features and modern gameplay. Experience challenging TBS action with high replayability value on the island world of Mantaria as you lead your army victoriously from battle to battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/2dd29ec25c5d7899696d7e7d16e72dae.poster.avif?t=1772593004\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/2dd29ec25c5d7899696d7e7d16e72dae.webm?t=1772593004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/2dd29ec25c5d7899696d7e7d16e72dae.mp4?t=1772593004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/b81ea16cc20ec7287a22f7dd2444522e.avif?t=1772593004\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Army</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command one of three unique avatars, each offering distinct skills and auras to shape your strategy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aglovan the Noble: </strong>A foreboding cavalry commander who excels at leading swift and powerful attacks. Use his commanding presence to rally a diverse army of unit types and classes, leveraging his aura to dominate the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warlord Karnoth</strong>: A barbarian leader with a focus on brute strength and tactical dominance. Command his army of strong infantry and flight units to crush your enemies with overwhelming force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sargon I:</strong> A spellcasting commander who empowers magic-driven armies. His presence strengthens allied sorcery while reducing incoming magical damage, supported by a faction of desert mystics and powerful units.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your units, transforming them into stronger and more powerful soldiers. Collect artifacts to further enhance your forces and unlock specialized abilities. Activate these abilities wisely to overcome the unholy brood and achieve victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Tactical Depth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize each avatar\u2019s and hero's distinct auras to gain the upper hand in battle. Free the &quot;heroes of the old wars&quot; and harness their power and auras to your advantage!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form strategically advantageous formations across the terrain to master challenges and overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Gather units into larger squads to fight against powerful enemies and withstand the onslaught of evil.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/09039d54b0096915d6cac771fbcfb9dc.poster.avif?t=1772593004\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/09039d54b0096915d6cac771fbcfb9dc.webm?t=1772593004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/09039d54b0096915d6cac771fbcfb9dc.mp4?t=1772593004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Diverse Biomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the undead army across several dynamic areas:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkwoods</strong>: Begin your campaign in a biome covered by forests, swamps, and rocky landscapes.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternal Ice:</strong> Push forward into a snowy tundra full of lethal traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lava Desert:\u00a0 </strong>Enter a scorching landscape where molten ground and environmental hazards offer fresh tactical opportunities and new enemies.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate Environmental Effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive randomly generated environmental effects such as lightning strikes, storms, or meteorites. These events do not distinguish between friend or foe and will strike either army without mercy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/95bfe224e44db7602e1ffdab6afe1323.poster.avif?t=1772593004\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/95bfe224e44db7602e1ffdab6afe1323.webm?t=1772593004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/95bfe224e44db7602e1ffdab6afe1323.mp4?t=1772593004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way to free the island world of Mantaria, make decisions that unlock certain levels and block others. Enter the battle again and again to experience all of the challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/79ccb8fdb81b7b051810a85cdd7052c3.poster.avif?t=1772593004\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/79ccb8fdb81b7b051810a85cdd7052c3.webm?t=1772593004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/extras/79ccb8fdb81b7b051810a85cdd7052c3.mp4?t=1772593004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"98c9283f7f5d23bf3aaa0c1696203706666d4931.jpg","localized_name":"Lord of the Darkwoods","name":"Lord of the Darkwoods","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1318240/98c9283f7f5d23bf3aaa0c1696203706666d4931.jpg"},{"icon":"12cde95459a0cc9c7b0da8ba6a7d9c74a6f7f495.jpg","localized_name":"Prince of the \"Eternal Ice\"","name":"Prince of the \"Eternal Ice\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1318240/12cde95459a0cc9c7b0da8ba6a7d9c74a6f7f495.jpg"},{"icon":"0bfbf7353a1099c5ebcbf09bbd532f8eb8622b52.jpg","localized_name":"Count of the Lava Desert","name":"Count of the Lava Desert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1318240/0bfbf7353a1099c5ebcbf09bbd532f8eb8622b52.jpg"},{"icon":"fa0482075b2ab8ed50678a06bd3bc7bf56cd413e.jpg","localized_name":"Ruler of Mantaria","name":"Ruler of Mantaria","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1318240/fa0482075b2ab8ed50678a06bd3bc7bf56cd413e.jpg"},{"icon":"7572f2371bf5509c8786033afe75d1ae08c3a653.jpg","localized_name":"Demon Vanquisher","name":"Demon Vanquisher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1318240/7572f2371bf5509c8786033afe75d1ae08c3a653.jpg"},{"icon":"7998dd665b9857977f4220515370872ff9903e74.jpg","localized_name":"Ghost Hunter","name":"Ghost Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1318240/7998dd665b9857977f4220515370872ff9903e74.jpg"},{"icon":"428b08eb67477a57898db136a4940aaea2126828.jpg","localized_name":"Good has triumphed","name":"Good has triumphed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1318240/428b08eb67477a57898db136a4940aaea2126828.jpg"},{"icon":"eb74ac66f78f7a8929f1d4a92e22c7ac743d0472.jpg","localized_name":"No one stays behind","name":"No one stays behind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1318240/eb74ac66f78f7a8929f1d4a92e22c7ac743d0472.jpg"},{"icon":"91e016d3de847d13ec9d58fa886633b608755d22.jpg","localized_name":"Captain of Infantry","name":"Captain of Infantry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1318240/91e016d3de847d13ec9d58fa886633b608755d22.jpg"},{"icon":"c7615d828c6849c33d6875314addec5d6f09b683.jpg","localized_name":"Commander of infantry","name":"Commander of infantry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1318240/c7615d828c6849c33d6875314addec5d6f09b683.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1318240?t=1772593004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/5c9a6f6f337b7d709508caf1127c6e9dc7471909/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772593004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/0fe2e521ff06c02df2f68f1edfb92623c7a907e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772593004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318240/0fe2e521ff06c02df2f68f1edfb92623c7a9